/-!
# Additive Cousin existence on the actual two-dimensional covering space

An arbitrary indexed open cover and its actual holomorphic additive
transition cocycle admit genuine holomorphic local cochain solutions.
The construction uses an actual subordinate smooth partition, globally
glued coordinate antiholomorphic derivatives, their proved closedness,
and the independently proved unrestricted global primitive theorem.
The result holds both in product coordinates and on the original native
`ComplexPlane₂`, with no global cochain or solver hypothesis.
-/
